.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd November 27, 2026
.Dt gs\-test\-gimp 1
.Os gs\-test\-gimp
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm gs\-test\-gimp
.Nd runs a short test to verify that GIMP can run a GIMP script in non\-GUI mode
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm gs\-test\-gimp
.Op Fl q | Fl \-quiet
.Op Fl w | Fl \-verbose
.Nm gs\-test\-gimp
.Op Fl h | Fl \-help
.Nm gs\-test\-gimp
.Op Fl v | Fl \-version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm gs\-test\-gimp
runs a short test to verify that GIMP can execute a Script\-Fu batch command in non\-GUI mode.
If
.Ev GIMP3\_DIRECTORY
is set to a non\-empty directory path,
.Nm
initialises its resource subdirectories and writes a minimal
.Pa gimprc
before starting
.Nm gimp\-console .
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl q | Fl \-quiet
Quiet mode: suppress GIMP console output. This is the default.
.It Fl w | Fl \-verbose
Verbose mode: print GIMP console output and processing details.
.It Fl h | Fl \-help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl \-version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Environment ######################################################
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ev GIMP3\_DIRECTORY
Required environment variable specifying the GIMP 3.x configuration directory.
If set to a non\-empty path, the directory and its
.Pa gimprc
file are created before launching GIMP; if set to an empty string, directory creation is skipped.
.It Ev GIMP2\_DIRECTORY
Optional configuration directory used by GIMP 2.x installations.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -bullet
.It
GIMP3\_DIRECTORY="" gs\-test\-gimp
.It
GIMP3\_DIRECTORY=/tmp/gimp3.tmp gs\-test\-gimp
.It
GIMP3\_DIRECTORY=/tmp/gimp3.tmp gs\-test\-gimp \-\-verbose
.It
gs\-test\-gimp \-\-help
.It
gs\-test\-gimp \-h
.It
gs\-test\-gimp \-\-version
.It
gs\-test\-gimp \-v
.El
